        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Benedek Lampert is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Hungarian",
            "zh": "匈牙利的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " toy photographer. He is good at creating photo stories with toys."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The 28-year-old has been a big fan of LEGOs since his early childhood. In 2016, he decided to create "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "miniature",
            "zh": "微型的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " worlds with LEGO toys. Many of his works have been "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "inspired",
            "ref": "v-inspire"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by famous movies. He usually spends hours building the whole "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "scene",
            "ref": "v-scene"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Almost everything in the scene is done by hand. For example, to create a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "plume",
            "zh": "团"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of smoke, he uses cotton. For snow, he uses "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "powdered sugar",
            "zh": "糖粉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The artist also "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "makes the best use of",
            "ref": "v-make-the-best-use-of"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " nature. When he wants to use the light of afternoon for a picture, he’ll wait for an actual sunset. If he needs a beach scene, he’ll take his LEGO set with him and go to the nearest seaside."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "lively",
            "ref": "v-lively"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "creative",
            "ref": "v-creative"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " pictures taken by Lampert have won him a lot of fans. As he becomes more and more popular on social media, some brands have even invited him to shoot "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "advertisements",
            "ref": "v-advertisement"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with LEGO toys!"
          }
        ]
      }
